rown 0.5% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It pays out 226% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["With about 29,400 employees, each generates about $235K of revenue, 0.1x the Real Estate median, and revenue has grown 5.4% a year across its filed history.","Free cash flow is negative, at -$32K per employee.","CEO pay is $3.5M (15x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $5K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INSUFFICIENT DATA","conv":null,"head":"Not enough data to value it: missing price or fair value.","pros":[],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":null,"vc":null,"med":{"pe":23.2295,"ev_ebitda":15.922,"pfcf":16.5997,"pb":1.2965,"roic":0.0405,"gross_margin":0.551,"fcf_margin":0.1749,"div_yield":0.0496}},"ticker":"IRM","date":"2026-11-20"}